  "details": "Community Homes are a Home type in VRChat where you can share a home world with your friends or Group members as soon as they enter VRChat. You simply invite a friend to your world and select \"Make this your Community Home\". Every time you enter VRChat, you might come across your friends or Group members. \n\nThe Community Home also has a button to copy and paste world IDs. Friends can share world IDs and have access to community homes this way also. \n\nCommunity homes can be a great place to meet members in your Group and hang out with friends.",
